          "code": "GENERATE_ADDITIONAL_PANEL",
          "id": "1776919544055",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776919544055_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Using the data array from {{$context.$nodes.REFINE_THE_ACCOUNTS.$output.result}}, generate a\nmultirecordWidget with columns: \"Account Name\", \"ARR Impact\", \"Risk Reason\", \"Renewal Date\",\n\"Status\".\n\nSet the widget title to a concise phrase of 6-7 words summarizing the data.\n\nSet the description to 2 professional, concise sentences reflecting overall insights from the data.\n\nPopulate columns as follows:\n- \"Account Name\": use the accountName property from each row.\n- \"ARR Impact\": use the arr property from each row, formatted in billions (B), millions (M), or\n  thousands (K) with two decimal places (e.g., 1.23B, 2.34M, 100K).\n- \"Risk Reason\": generate a concise 3-word reason based on the riskDetailedExplainer property in\n  each row.\n- \"Renewal Date\": use the renewalDate property from each row.\n- \"Status\": display as a badge based on riskClassification property:\n    * If \"Critical\", badge text \"Critical\" with alert priority.\n    * If \"High\", badge text \"High\" with alert priority.\n    * If \"Moderate\", badge text \"Moderate\" with warning priority.\n    * If \"Stable\", badge text \"Stable\" with info priority.\n\nDo not create action for each row\n\nDo not include raw data, identifiers, or technical details in the output."
            },
            {
              "id": "1776919544055_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Output must follow multiRecordWidget pattern. Must not include action for every row"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 6987.5,
            "y": 6814
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Identify Action",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let result = \"\";\ntry {\n  let oraActionRaw = $context.$app?.$OraAction || \"\";\n\n  if (typeof oraActionRaw !== \"string\") {\n    if (typeof oraActionRaw === \"object\" && oraActionRaw !== null) {\n      oraActionRaw = oraActionRaw.OraAction || \"\";\n    } else {\n      oraActionRaw = \"\";\n    }\n  } else {\n    const trimmed = oraActionRaw.trim();\n    if ((trimmed.startsWith(\"{\") && trimmed.endsWith(\"}\")) || (trimmed.startsWith(\"[\") && trimmed.endsWith(\"]\"))) {\n      try {\n        const parsed = JSON.parse(trimmed);\n        oraActionRaw = parsed?.OraAction || \"\";\n      } catch (e) {\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  const oraAction = oraActionRaw.startsWith(\"<\") ? oraActionRaw.substring(1) : oraActionRaw;\n\n  const possibleActions = [\n    \"createProgram\",\n    \"sendEmailToCSM\",\n    \"sendToSales\",\n    \"addAccountToProgram\",\n    \"showRiskAccounts\",\n    \"createFormToAddAllAccountsToProgram\",\n    \"oraFormSubmit\"\n  ];\n\n  const matchedAction = possibleActions.find(action => oraAction.startsWith(action));\n\n  result = matchedAction || \"\";\n} catch (error) {\n  result = \"\";\n}\n\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1781627600846"
          },
          "code": "IDENTIFY_ACTION",
          "id": "1778524155807",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 6537.5,
            "y": 6592
          }
