          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}"
        },
        {
          "id": "1781205614302",
          "code": "PROGRAM_CREATION_CONFIRMATION",
          "type": "LLM",
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Program Creation Confirmation"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 5000,
            "y": 9256
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765590908569_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate exactly this output shape and no other text.\n\n  Source values:\n  - Program payload: {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_PROGRAM_PAYLOAD.$output.result}}\n  - Program id: {{$context.$nodes.GETLOCATIONHEADER.$output.result}}\n  - Program type: Renewals\n  - Target product name: {{$context.$variables.targetProductName}}\n\n  Extraction rules:\n  - Program name = Program payload field `name`.\n  - Industries = from Program payload `programAttributes.items`, include only items where `key` is `\"industry\"`, use `displayValue` if present\n  otherwise `value`, remove null/empty values, remove duplicates, and join with comma + space.\n  - If any value is missing, use an empty string.\n  - Do not output the word `null`.\n\n  Output exactly:\n\n  <oraInfoDisplay key=\"unique-<programId>\">\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Program Created\",\n    \"patternId\": \"cardWidget\",\n    \"description\": \"\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"subject\": \"Program <programName> created.\",\n      \"summary\": \"<targetProductName> <programType> - Program created to promote in industries <industries> across all regions.\",\n      \"badgeText\": \"Success\",\n      \"variant\": \"success\",\n      \"link\": {\n        \"text\": \"View Program\",\n        \"action\": \"ora.Invoke(\\\"NavigateToPrograms\\\",\\\"programId=<programId>,programType=Renewals\\\")\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  </oraInfoDisplay>\n\n  <oraImmediateInsight>\n  {\n    \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Invoke(\\\"refresh\\\")\"\n  }\n  </oraImmediateInsight>\n\n  Hard constraints:\n  - Replace every placeholder before output.\n  - Output only one oraInfoDisplay.\n  - Output only one oraImmediateInsight.\n  - Do not include any text before, between, or after these XML tags.\n  - Do not include any other action.\n  - The only link text must be \"View Program\".\n  - Keep the action string exactly in this format: ora.Invoke(\"NavigateToPrograms\",\"programId=<programId>,programType=Renewal\")"
            },
            {
              "id": "1781088160359_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            }
          ],
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "enableActions": true,
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_CARD"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
