            {
              "id": "1778525084180_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Using the data array from {{$context.$nodes.REFINE_ACCOUNTS_FOR_PROGRAM.$output.result}}, generate a\nmessageListWidget.\n\nSet the widget title to a concise phrase of 6-7 words summarizing the data on adding the\naccounts to a program mentioning the total number of accounts on the riskClassification and the total ARR associated with them for adding to the program, formatted to the nearest Million/Billion/Thousand with units M/B/K\n\nSet the description to 2 professional, concise sentences reflecting the overall insights from the data and how adding it to a program might help.\n\nFor each row in the data array, create a list row with:\n- title: the accountName field from the row\n- subtitle: \"ARR Impact\" followed by the arr field formatted with appropriate units (B for\n  billion, M for million, K for thousand), e.g., 1.23B, 3.54M, 100K\n- summary: a precise insight generated from the riskDetailedExplainer field of the row\n- badgeText: <riskClassification>\n- priority: if riskClassification is Stable then \"info\", if riskClassification is Medium then \"warning\" \n- action: \"ora.Invoke(\\\"launchAccount\\\", {\\\"targetProductId\\\": \\\"{{$context.$variables.targetProductId}} \\\", \\\"targetProductName\\\": \\\"{{$context.$variables.targetProductName}} \\\", \\\"accountId\\\": \\\"<accountIdentifier for each row>\\\"})\"\n\nDo not include any timestamps in the output.\n\nCreate a low priority oraInsight action with:\n- title: \"Add All Accounts to Program\"\n- shortDescription: \"Add All Accounts to Program\"\n- actionText: \"Add all Accounts to Program\"\n- followUpCommand: \"ora.Invoke(\\\"createFormToAddAllAccountsToProgram\\\", \\\"createFormToAddAllAccountsToProgram{\\\"targetProductId\\\": \\\"{{$context.$variables.targetProductId}}\\\", \\\"targetProductName\\\": \\\"{{$context.$variables.targetProductName}}\\\", \\\"accountIdsList\\\": \\\"{{accountIdsList}}\\\"}\\\")\"\n- priority: false\n\nReplace {{accountIdsList}} with the comma-separated accountIdentifier field from all rows."
            }
          ],
