          },
          "code": "PROGRAMS",
          "id": "1778535698205",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "REFERENCEABLEBLOCK",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 9257.5,
            "y": 5000,
            "width": 600,
            "height": 792
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "1781627489628",
          "code": "GENERATE_CREATE_PROGRAM_ERROR_WIDGET",
          "type": "LLM",
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Create Program Error Widget"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 9957.5,
            "y": 5000
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1781627489628_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate the error-state UI in exactly two widgets, in this order:\n\n  1. First widget: one `cardWidget`\n  2. Second widget: one editable `recordWidget`\n\n  Source values:\n  - Program payload: {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_PROGRAM_PAYLOAD.$output.result}}\n  - Target product id: {{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_FORM_PARAMETERS.$output.result.targetProductId}}\n  - Target product name: {{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_FORM_PARAMETERS.$output.result.targetProductName}}\n  - Program type: Renewals\n  - Regions: All\n\n  Extraction rules:\n  - <targetProductId> = {{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_FORM_PARAMETERS.$output.result.targetProductId}}\n  - <targetProductName> = {{$context.$nodes.RETRIEVE_FORM_PARAMETERS.$output.result.targetProductName}}\n  - <programName> = {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_PROGRAM_PAYLOAD.$output.result.name}}\n  - <programObjective> = {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_PROGRAM_PAYLOAD.$output.result.objective}}\n  - <externalTrackingCode> = {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_PROGRAM_PAYLOAD.$output.result.externalCode}}\n  - <programType> = Renewals\n  - <regions> = All\n  - <industries> = derive from {{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_PROGRAM_PAYLOAD.$output.result.programAttributes.items}} by using only items where\n  `key` is `\"industry\"`, using `displayValue` if present otherwise `value`, removing null/empty values and duplicates, then joining with comma +\n  space.\n  - If any value is missing, use an empty string.\n  - Do not output the word `null`.\n\n  Output only valid `oraInfoDisplay` widgets plus the final `oraImmediateInsight`. Do not output commentary.\n\n  Widget 1 requirements:\n  - `patternId`: `cardWidget`\n  - `title`: `Review Key Program Details`\n  - `description`: `Program Type: <programType>, Regions: <regions>, Industries: <industries>. After creating the program, you can review the\n  audience, tactics, and finish configuring the program.`\n  - `properties.subject`: `Program Creation Failed`\n  - `properties.summary`: `Program Name already exists, please enter a different name.`\n  - `properties.badgeText`: `Error`\n  - `properties.variant`: `error`\n\n  Widget 2 requirements:\n  - `patternId`: `recordWidget`\n  - Do not include any `title`\n  - Do not include any `description`\n  - `properties.id` must be exactly:\n    `targetProductId_<targetProductId>_targetProductName_<targetProductName>`\n  - `properties.readOnly` must be exactly `false`\n  - `properties.fields` must contain exactly these 3 fields in this order and no others:\n\n  1.\n  - `id`: `ProgramName`\n  - `label`: `Program Name`\n  - `value`: `{{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_PROGRAM_PAYLOAD.$output.result.name}}`\n  - `type`: `text`\n\n  2.\n  - `id`: `ProgramObjective`\n  - `label`: `Program Objective`\n  - `value`: `{{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_PROGRAM_PAYLOAD.$output.result.objective}}`\n  - `type`: `text`\n\n  3.\n  - `id`: `ExternalTrackingCode`\n  - `label`: `External Tracking Code`\n  - `value`: `{{$context.$nodes.BUILD_CREATE_PROGRAM_PAYLOAD.$output.result.externalCode}}`\n  - `type`: `text`\n\n  Important rendering rules:\n  - Replace every placeholder before output.\n  - The first widget must appear first and must contain the heading and description.\n  - The second widget must be form-only.\n  - `Review Key Program Details` must appear only once.\n  - The program type / regions / industries description must appear only once.\n  - The error badge/message must appear before the text boxes.\n  - The text boxes must remain editable and visibly prefilled.\n  - Keep the existing submit behavior by preserving a valid editable `recordWidget`.\n  - Preserve the renewal form id format exactly: `targetProductId_<targetProductId>_targetProductName_<targetProductName>`.\n  - Do not include any `View Program` link.\n  - Do not include any `NavigateToPrograms` action.\n  - Do not add any new fields.\n  - Do not add any extra sections.\n  - Do not repeat the error message anywhere else.\n\n  After the two widgets, include exactly:\n\n  <oraImmediateInsight>\n    {\n      \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Invoke(\\\"refresh\\\")\"\n    }\n  </oraImmediateInsight>"
            }
          ],
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_CARD"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "End of data pipeline",
            "name": "End"
          },
          "outcomes": {},
          "code": "END",
          "id": "end",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "END"
        }
